 "stimulus_html": "In the following exercises, you are rolling a special 6-sided die that has both a colored letter and a colored number on each face. The faces are labeled with: a red 1 and a blue A, a red 1 and a green A, an orange 1 and a green B, an orange 2 and a red C, a purple 3 and a brown D, an orange 4 and a blue E. You will roll the die once and take note of something about the face that is showing. Identify the sample space:",
